As recorded in the files (`#print axioms` under `#guard_msgs`, or
`#axioms_within`), and for the declarations whose file records no pin, as
reported by `#print axioms` on the build of this document.

* No axioms: `OI`, `OM`, `OSR` (no pin recorded).
* `propext` only: `box_mono`, `soundness` (no pin recorded), `dichotomy`.
* `propext`, `Quot.sound`: `dichotomy_exclusive`.
* `propext`, `Classical.choice`, `Quot.sound`: `consequence_iff_derivable`
  (no pin recorded), `closed_lax_infinite`, `sat_rn_odd` and `sat_rn_even`
  (no pin recorded), `rnSub_deriv_iff`, `rn_pairwise_pll`, `width_infinite`,
